{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09342","headline":"陪王卿郎中游南池 · 韦应物","name":"陪王卿郎中游南池","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鵷鸿俱失侣，同爲此地游。\n露浥荷花气，风散柳园秋。\n烟草凝衰屿，星汉泛归流。\n林高初上月，塘深未转舟。\n清言屡往复，华樽始献酬。\n终忆秦川赏，端坐起离忧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09342.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09342","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}